OL,3,GNEWSAGuy's Hospital pilots prostate
OL,4,Acancer treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first NHS use of a new laser
OL,7,Ftherapy to treat prostate cancer has
OL,8,Fshown promising results, a London
OL,9,Fhospital has said.
OL,11,FGuy's Hospital in Southwark is using
OL,12,FProFocal laser therapy in a pilot study
OL,13,Fto treat 30 patients with localised
OL,14,Fprostate cancer.
OL,16,FThe hospital said among the first 10
OL,17,Fpatients treated by the therapy, eight
OL,18,Fhad their cancer completely eradicated
OL,19,Fin the treated area, and two had a
OL,20,Fminimal amount remaining.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
