OL,3,GNEWSAGuy's Hospital pilots prostate
OL,4,Acancer treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex McWhirter, 77, a semi-retired
OL,7,Ftravel journalist, was one of the
OL,8,Fpatients in the pilot. He said:
OL,9,F"Compared to the other options, such as
OL,10,Fsurgical removal of the prostate or
OL,11,Fradiotherapy, this really feels like a
OL,12,Fhuge leap forward."
